.Dd November 15, 2026
.Dt MAN 1
.Os RavenBSD
.Sh NAME
.Nm man
.Nd display RavenBSD manual pages
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl hV
.Op Fl -color Ns = Ns Ar auto|always|never
.Op Ar section
.Ar name
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
locates an mdoc page under
.Pa /usr/share/man
and renders it with the built-in first-party renderer.
The optional
.Ar section
selects one manual section; without it,
.Nm
searches sections 1, 2, 4 and 8 in that order.
No index is required.
.Pp
Colour is used only for a terminal and is never written to a pipe, to JSON-like machine output
or when
.Ev NO_COLOR
or
.Ev TERM=dumb
is set.
An explicit
.Fl -color=always
forces colour for human output.
.Sh OPTIONS
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Fl h , Fl -help
Print the usage line and exit 0.
.It Fl V , Fl -version
Print the version and exit 0.
.It Fl -color Ns = Ns Ar policy
Select
.Ar auto ,
.Ar always
or
.Ar never .
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Ev MANPATH
Colon-separated directories added after the default root.
.It Ev MANWIDTH
Wrapping width; values below 20 or above 300 are ignored.
.It Ev COLUMNS
Fallback wrapping width when
.Ev MANWIDTH
is absent.
.It Ev MANPAGER , Ev PAGER
Pager command; the rendered page is passed as a file argument.
The built-in renderer is used when neither is set.
.It Ev NO_COLOR
Disable automatic colour.
.It Ev TERM
A terminal name; the literal
.Dq dumb
disables automatic colour.
.It Ev COLORTERM
The value
.Dq truecolor
selects 24-bit output.
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width Ds
.It Pa /usr/share/man
Default manual root.
.It Pa /etc/man.conf
Additional manual roots, one per line.
.It Pa /tmp/man.page
Temporary rendered page used for an external pager.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Ex -std
A missing page exits 1; a usage error exits 2.
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr ls 1 ,
.Xr raven 1 ,
.Xr init 8
.Sh STANDARDS
RavenBSD.
